            <var>center</var> point of the arc radius: The
            <var>radius</var> of the arc startAngle: The starting
            angle in degrees endAngle: The ending angle in
            degrees clockwise: <code>YES</code> for
            <var>clockwise</var> direction, <code>NO</code> for
            counterclockwise
          </desc>
        </method>
